  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;table cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border: none; margin-left: 5.4pt; width: 441.85pt;&quot; class=&quot;Table cke_show_border&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;604&quot; style=&quot;width:452.65pt&quot;&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;The proposal would result in the loss of existing residential floorspace and no justification or reprovision has been provided to demonstrate that this loss is acceptable. The development would therefore result in an unwarranted reduction in the Borough’s housing stock, contrary to the relevant provisions in the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies H8A of the London Plan (2021), and HO1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border-style:none; border-width:0px&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;604&quot; style=&quot;width:452.65pt&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;",
    "&lt;table cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border: none; margin-left: 5.4pt; width: 441.85pt;&quot; class=&quot;Table cke_show_border&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;604&quot; style=&quot;width:452.65pt&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border-style:none; border-width:0px&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;604&quot; style=&quot;width:452.65pt&quot;&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Insufficient information has been provided to demonstrate the proposal would address an identified local need for the proposed residential institution and that the development is located within the community it is intended to serve, including a lack of detail addressing impacts of the proposal regarding residential amenity, noise, waste provision, transport and minimisation of crime and social disorder. As such, the proposed change of use would be inappropriate for this site contrary to the relevant provisions of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies H12 of the London Plan (2021) and HO7 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;"
  ],
